      "stated_by": "Dana Whitlock"
    },
    {
      "key": "dana-hallway-refusal",
      "person_key": "dana",
      "text": "Omar said Dana turned down his backfill request because he raised it verbally in a hallway conversation instead of writing it up.",
      "observed_at": "2025-11-04T16:00:00Z",
      "stated_by": "Omar Haddad"
    },
    {
      "key": "dana-hallway-retold",
      "person_key": "dana",
      "text": "Omar retold, at the team offsite, the story of Dana refusing his hallway backfill request.",
      "observed_at": "2026-02-12T11:00:00Z",
      "stated_by": "Omar Haddad"
    },
    {
      "key": "dana-load-data",
      "person_key": "dana",
      "text": "In a 1:1 Dana told Wen she prefers to decide on headcount after seeing at least two weeks of on-call load data, not before.",
      "observed_at": "2026-06-18T13:00:00Z",
      "stated_by": "Dana Whitlock"
    },
    {
      "key": "dana-fast-contractor",
      "person_key": "dana",
      "text": "Wen noted that in the Q3 budget review Dana approved a contractor within the meeting when a customer escalation was at stake — the only same-day approval Wen has seen from her.",
      "observed_at": "2026-07-22T12:00:00Z",
      "stated_by": "Wen Qiao"
    },
    {
      "key": "sam-okafor-cost-of-nothing",
      "person_key": "sam-okafor",
      "text": "Sam Okafor said every budget request should show the cost of doing nothing.",
